      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BIOLLANTE (4) was a strong winner (29.47) from box 3 last time, scoring by 3.5 lengths at this track. Has a tricky draw to overcome and will need a clean break. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Expected to measure up again. RHYTHMIC ENERGY (2) doesn't show much early dash but winds into his races, hitting the line hard to score two back then came home strongly into second (29.85) in a Grade 5 at this track last time. Has a good record at this journey. The form out of last race has been strong. Expecting another good run. PERFECT PICTURE (8) was a little disappointing last start at The Meadows when 4th (30.20) over 525m. Has a strong winning record here at this journey including two wins. Expected to feature in the finish. IAN ALBERT (1) was below best last time at this track (30.02) in a Grade 4, finishing a 7 length fifth. Has already won two times from this draw.",
